WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
[Electronic instrumental music]
nC — Control at every level.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:04.250
Functions: ref main ->> run.
[Mechanical clicks]

00:00:04.250 --> 00:00:05.500
Root [@]: rootCore[@].

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:06.750
Machine [@machine]: add rax, rbx;
jmp.ov overflow.

00:00:06.750 --> 00:00:08.000
Primitive: portWrite uart0.data &lt;- 0x41.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:09.233
ncc pipeline: Source (.n).
[Mechanical signal moves from left to right]

00:00:09.233 --> 00:00:10.400
Analysis (AST).

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:11.567
Representation (IR).

00:00:11.567 --> 00:00:12.733
Materialization (ABI).

00:00:12.733 --> 00:00:14.000
Execution (PE/ELF).

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:15.600
Compile hello.n for Windows x86-64,
then run hello.exe.

00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.000
Hello, nC public beta.
Exit code 0.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:20.000
ncc-lenguage.org
